      "hypotheses": "Assume the unitary field conditions, d > 0 with a square root of −d in E and ℚℓ, the odd-rank limit for each pair, and the fixed-weight crystalline and joint Weil–Deligne closure results. For each local Weil element, every finite moment cutoff and every positive tolerance, a single finite combination of local approximants controls the global traces at all group elements and every local moment up to the cutoff.",
